        "text": "This is a large room full of assorted heavy machinery, whirring noisily. The room smells of burned resistors. Along one wall are three buttons which are, respectively, round, triangular, and square. Naturally, above these buttons are instructions written in EBCDIC. A large sign in English above all the buttons says\n       \"DANGER -- HIGH VOLTAGE\"\nThere are exits to the west and the south."
